# Supabase connection.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in from your project's
# Settings → API page. Leave both blank (or delete the file) and the app runs
# entirely on local data exactly as before — no network, no backend.
#
# The anon key is safe in the browser: it is public by design, and row-level
# security in supabase/schema.sql is what actually protects the data.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
